  "model": "glm-4.7-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-05T12:06:45.083071Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-05T13:54:38.902933Z",
  "totalBlocks": 32,
  "translatedBlocks": 28,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65ee0572f9881bb0",
      "translationZh": "我一直在真实任务上测试 harness & 模型设置：基础数学、视觉、计算机使用（读取邮件、导航商店）和编码。我创建了一个基准和一个排行榜。您可以在这里查看：https://airbench.ai/leaderboard?k=poL",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98b83050855fcc07",
      "translationZh": "它衡量能力（各任务上的成功百分比）和速度。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c89eace06731ec34",
      "translationZh": "作为参考，Claude Code Opus 5.5 的得分是 100%（14分26秒）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "370e83b3b55f3661",
      "translationZh": "可以在本地使用 zcode/4xRTX6k/glm-5.3-flash-NVFP4 达到相同得分：100%（31分13秒）。质量相同，只是稍慢一些。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "faffd6dcc42d7f1c",
      "translationZh": "如果您接受一点点误差，可以加速：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e361922f574c128",
      "translationZh": "DSHv0.2rc2/RTXPRO6000WS/qwen3.8-flash-next-NVFP4：98%（23分30秒）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ad1ac5dc4143de7",
      "translationZh": "qwen3.8-flash-next-iq3_xxs-strata 是速度首选：在 opencode 上为 96%（7分41秒），在 omp 上为 94%（11分31秒）。是的，比 Claude Code 更快!!!!",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0780ca6755310798",
      "translationZh": "在本地硬件上，harness 与模型同样重要。在相同的 5090 上，相同的 strata quant 根据 harness 的不同，得分范围在 22% 到 96% 之间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0edd47096a58515",
      "translationZh": "本地现在可以匹敌专有模型。两个示例",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9463a5bc3da7e89d",
      "translationZh": "最佳模型（单张 RTX 5090）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fbb537cbd1ac7c63",
      "translationZh": "swift-1.5-qwen3.8-27b-q6_k 是最稳健的。它在 pi / omp / opencode 上得分为 96 / 94 / 92%，在 5 个测试套件上的平均得分为 82%，这是所有在多个测试中测试的模型中的最高分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb0df05887c8c775",
      "translationZh": "qwen3.8-flash-next-iq3_xxs-strata 是速度之选：在 opencode 上用 7 分 41 秒达到 96%，在 omp 上用 11 分 31 秒达到 94%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4956f281f9abfd52",
      "translationZh": "qwen3.8-27b-nvfp4 可以达到 96%，但需要 1 小时 40 分钟到 1 小时 50 分钟，并且高度依赖于测试套件（性能在 37% 到 96% 之间波动）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e04b62833618016",
      "translationZh": "有害因素：MTP 变体每次都会失去优势（nvfp4-mtp 平均 52%，而未使用时为 70%；在 pi 上使用 MTP 时，swift 的得分从 96% 下降到 55%）。65k 上下文也会造成伤害（45%–61%）。Gemma-4-26b 速度快但最高只有 47%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f991defc99b0e1e",
      "translationZh": "为了公平比较，我使用了在同一张 5090 上所有五个测试套件都运行的三个模型（swift q6_k、flash-next-strata、27b-nvfp4）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "abcfa62d8ef8203b",
      "translationZh": "opencode：平均 94%（92 / 96 / 94）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9aa44450bd5c475",
      "translationZh": "Opencode 和 omp 是唯一无论给予哪种模型都能保持在 85% 以上的测试框架。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db870db628c0c9c6",
      "translationZh": "Pi 在某些模型上表现优异，而在其他模型上则不可靠。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ecc94133597b998",
      "translationZh": "Hermes 虽然得分很高，但速度很慢：其大多数本地运行耗时 1 小时 20 分钟以上，有些甚至达到 2 小时的上限，因此其得分部分是由于答案到达太晚导致的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a6c80e06c91dae4",
      "translationZh": "云端运行显示了相同的模式。使用 deepseek-v4.1-flash 时，omp、pi 和 opencode 的得分均为 98%，而 hermes 得分为 82%。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59af94c62b6103e4",
      "translationZh": "如果你今天有一张 5090：为了可靠性，请使用 opencode 或 omp 配合 swift-1.5-qwen3.8-27b-q6_k，或者为了速度，请配合 qwen3.8-flash-next-strata 使用。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c884a4af82c94264",
      "translationZh": "好的，如果你想阅读更多像这样的详细分析，你也可以做出贡献！",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "276313b5296556fb",
      "translationZh": "我的网站允许每个人对其配置进行基准测试并贡献到排行榜上。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "231918fa0436b4e1",
      "translationZh": "测试你的本地代理非常简单：只需复制网站为你生成的提示词。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d9a3b80dee1a317",
      "translationZh": "我希望我们能在各种硬件上测试更多配置。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "508e70770ccaeaba",
      "translationZh": "（1）该网站需要登录，对此表示抱歉，但这有助于防止虚假提交。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c094082857493575",
      "translationZh": "（2）网站没有询问关于配置的足够细节，所以请使用备注字段详细记录你的设置。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f11b13183866bfa8",
      "translationZh": "告诉我你的想法。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    }
  ],
